Purpose of Position

Own the product agenda for how AI creates real, measurable value across Awin - translating AI capability into shipped product outcomes, not experiments.&nbsp;

Context &nbsp;

Thousands of advertisers and publishers who stay on Awin platform because of the people and product behind the service. The next chapter of Awin's product strategy is defined by how deliberately we put AI to work - not as a slogan, but as a set of practical capabilities embedded into what we build and how the business runs. &nbsp;

Most companies treat AI as a layer bolted onto existing product thinking. We want the opposite: a Head of Product who treats AI as core to the product strategy itself - where it belongs, what it should never touch, and how it compounds value over time rather than producing one-off wins. &nbsp;

