About WPP Media

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships - all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open - we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. 

WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.

For more information, visit wppmedia.com .

Role Summary and Impact   &nbsp;

We are looking for a highly motivated Senior Associate to join the WPP Media Clients Team. As the primary point of contact for a portfolio of clients, you will manage their advertising needs end to end across all channels (may include digital/non-digital or biddable/non-biddable). Your primary responsibilities will include developing and maintaining strong relationships with clients, understanding their business goals, and translating these into effective advertising strategies. You will oversee the entire campaign lifecycle, from initial strategy and planning to setup, execution, and ongoing optimization. Your role is crucial in ensuring that campaigns are delivered on time, within budget, and meet or exceed client expectations. Through meticulous planning and continuous performance analysis, you will drive successful outcomes and deliver exceptional value to our clients. &nbsp;

3 Best things about the job: &nbsp;

• Opportunities for professional development and growth. &nbsp;

• Opportunity to interact and learn from the best people in WPP Media to drive excellence in media, content and technology. &nbsp;

• Grow your potential in a team culture built on collective energy, passion, collaboration and support. &nbsp;

  &nbsp;

Key Responsibilities:  &nbsp;

Client Relationship &amp; Servicing: &nbsp;

• Client Champion: Proactively communicate with clients, providing regular updates on campaign performance, industry trends, and new opportunities. Manage client expectations effectively and ensure their satisfaction with our services. &nbsp;

• Trusted Advisor: Build and maintain strong, long-lasting relationships with clients based on trust, transparency, and proactive communication. Become a trusted advisor, providing strategic guidance and recommendations to help clients achieve their business goals. &nbsp;

Account Management &amp; Strategy: &nbsp;

• Data-Driven Approach: You will leverage a data-driven approach to optimize campaign performance and drive client success. &nbsp;

• This involves utilizing advanced analytics and data insights to inform strategy, planning, and execution. &nbsp;

• You will analyse key performance metrics, identify trends, and make data-backed decisions to enhance the effectiveness of advertising campaigns. &nbsp;

• Strategic Insight: Develop a deep understanding of client businesses, target audiences, competitive landscapes, and industry trends. &nbsp;

• Goal-Oriented Planning: Collaborate with clients to define clear and measurable campaign objectives, aligning advertising strategies with overall business goals. &nbsp;

• Cross-Channel Expertise: Develop comprehensive advertising strategies and media plans across all relevant channels. &nbsp;

• Management: Determine appropriate budgets and allocate resources effectively across different channels to optimize campaign performance. &nbsp;

